msgstr "Admin Toolbar Extra Tools"

msgid "Adds menu links like Flush cache, Run cron, Run updates, and Logout under Drupal icon."
msgstr "Voegt menulinks zoals Flush cache, Run cron, Run updates en Logout toe onder Drupal-pictogram."

